{"id":"b230b875687723ed","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-first-order-language.md","title":"Language-Indexed First-Order Syntax","display":"df-first-order-language — Language-Indexed First-Order Syntax","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-first-order-language","aliases":["92-df-first-order-language"],"display":"df-first-order-language — Language-Indexed First-Order Syntax","source":"本地扩展所需的一般一阶语法；给定 PDF 第 II 章仅定义其指定算术语言","source_status":"原书之外的语法桥接","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-first-order-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-first-order-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-language — Language-Indexed First-Order Syntax"},{"key":"source","html":"本地扩展所需的一般一阶语法；给定 PDF 第 II 章仅定义其指定算术语言"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书之外的语法桥接"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>元理论为通常 ZFC；变量集合固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，这些变量与本地算术变量同名。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,R\">\\(F,R\\)</span> 是不交的函数、关系符号集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_F:F\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(a_F:F\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_R:R\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(a_R:R\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是元数映射；零元函数是常量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)\">\\(L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tm}_L,\\mathrm{Fml}_L,\\mathrm{FV}_L,\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Tm}_L,\\mathrm{Fml}_L,\\mathrm{FV}_L,\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 是定义目标。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UCl}_L,\\mathrm{Subst}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{UCl}_L,\\mathrm{Subst}_L\\)</span> 是全称闭包和无捕获代入的定义目标。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var},\\mathrm{app},\\mathrm{eq},\\mathrm{rel},\\mathrm{neg},\\mathrm{and},\\mathrm{or},\\mathrm{imp},\\mathrm{all},\\mathrm{ex}\">\\(\\mathrm{var},\\mathrm{app},\\mathrm{eq},\\mathrm{rel},\\mathrm{neg},\\mathrm{and},\\mathrm{or},\\mathrm{imp},\\mathrm{all},\\mathrm{ex}\\)</span> 是下文定义的构造器首标签。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p>下面的构造器表示带不同首标签的有限树：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}=0\">\\(\\mathrm{var}=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{app}=1\">\\(\\mathrm{app}=1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{eq}=2\">\\(\\mathrm{eq}=2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rel}=3\">\\(\\mathrm{rel}=3\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{neg}=4\">\\(\\mathrm{neg}=4\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{and}=5\">\\(\\mathrm{and}=5\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{or}=6\">\\(\\mathrm{or}=6\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{imp}=7\">\\(\\mathrm{imp}=7\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{all}=8\">\\(\\mathrm{all}=8\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex}=9\">\\(\\mathrm{ex}=9\\)</span>。例如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\vec t)\">\\(f(\\vec t)\\)</span> 编为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1,f,\\vec t)\">\\((1,f,\\vec t)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\varphi\">\\(\\forall x\\varphi\\)</span> 编为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(8,x,\\varphi)\">\\((8,x,\\varphi)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists F,R,a_F,a_R\\;(L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)\\land F\\cap R=\\varnothing\n\\land a_F:F\\to\\mathbb N\\land a_R:R\\to\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists F,R,a_F,a_R\\;(L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)\\land F\\cap R=\\varnothing\n\\land a_F:F\\to\\mathbb N\\land a_R:R\\to\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tm}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Tm}_L\\)</span> 是包含所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{var}(v_i)\">\\(\\mathrm{var}(v_i)\\)</span>、并在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_L^{a_F(f)}\">\\(\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_L^{a_F(f)}\\)</span> 时包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\vec t)\">\\(f(\\vec t)\\)</span> 的最小集合。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\)</span> 是包含所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=t\">\\(s=t\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(\\vec t)\">\\(r(\\vec t)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_L\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in R\">\\(r\\in R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_L^{a_R(r)}\">\\(\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_L^{a_R(r)}\\)</span>），并对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall x,\\exists x\">\\(\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall x,\\exists x\\)</span> 闭合的最小集合。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\mathrm{var}(x))&amp;=\\{x\\},&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_L(f(\\vec t))&amp;=\\bigcup_{j&lt;a_F(f)}\\mathrm{FV}_L(t_j),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_L(s=t)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_L(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_L(t),&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_L(r(\\vec t))&amp;=\\bigcup_{j&lt;a_R(r)}\\mathrm{FV}_L(t_j),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi),&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\psi)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_L(Qx\\varphi)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L:\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\mathrm{var}(x))&amp;=\\{x\\},&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_L(f(\\vec t))&amp;=\\bigcup_{j&lt;a_F(f)}\\mathrm{FV}_L(t_j),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_L(s=t)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_L(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_L(t),&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_L(r(\\vec t))&amp;=\\bigcup_{j&lt;a_R(r)}\\mathrm{FV}_L(t_j),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi),&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\psi)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_L(Qx\\varphi)&amp;=\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_L&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L:\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UCl}_L(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{UCl}_L(\\varphi)\\)</span> 按递增变量下标绑定全部自由变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UCl}_L[A]=\\{\\mathrm{UCl}_L(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in A\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{UCl}_L[A]=\\{\\mathrm{UCl}_L(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in A\\}\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_L(\\varphi,t,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_L(\\varphi,t,x)\\)</span> 递归替换自由的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>；量词先换成该矩阵、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 中完全未出现的最小下标变量，再递归替换。项按树高、公式按逻辑度递归；改名保持逻辑度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限树高度归纳给出最小文法集合、唯一解析、有限自由变量集及递归函数的存在和唯一性。构造器首标签保证变量、常量和关系原子不会混同。\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq L&#39;\">\\(L\\subseteq L&#39;\\)</span>，含义是函数/关系集合包含且元数映射为限制；约化只删新符号解释。添加常量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 时只扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 并规定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_F(c)=0\">\\(a_F(c)=0\\)</span>；添加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 元关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 时只扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 并规定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_R(P)=r\">\\(a_R(P)=r\\)</span>。\n本节点不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> 的别名；本地 token 字串需经过后续节点的解析翻译，才是这里的有限树。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"F,R","display":false},{"tex":"a_F:F\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"a_R:R\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tm}_L,\\mathrm{Fml}_L,\\mathrm{FV}_L,\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UCl}_L,\\mathrm{Subst}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{var},\\mathrm{app},\\mathrm{eq},\\mathrm{rel},\\mathrm{neg},\\mathrm{and},\\mathrm{or},\\mathrm{imp},\\mathrm{all},\\mathrm{ex}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{var}=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{app}=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{eq}=2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{rel}=3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{neg}=4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{and}=5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{or}=6","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{imp}=7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{all}=8","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex}=9","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\vec t)","display":false},{"tex":"(1,f,\\vec t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"(8,x,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists F,R,a_F,a_R\\;(L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)\\land F\\cap R=\\varnothing\n\\land a_F:F\\to\\mathbb N\\land a_R:R\\to\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tm}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{var}(v_i)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_L^{a_F(f)}","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\vec t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_L","display":false},{"tex":"s=t","display":false},{"tex":"r(\\vec t)","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_L","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_L^{a_R(r)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\forall x,\\exists x","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\mathrm{var}(x))&=\\{x\\},&\\mathrm{FV}_L(f(\\vec t))&=\\bigcup_{j<a_F(f)}\\mathrm{FV}_L(t_j),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_L(s=t)&=\\mathrm{FV}_L(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_L(t),&\\mathrm{FV}_L(r(\\vec t))&=\\bigcup_{j<a_R(r)}\\mathrm{FV}_L(t_j),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\neg\\varphi)&=\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi),&\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)&=\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\psi)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_L(Qx\\varphi)&=\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_L&\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L:\\mathrm{FV}_L(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UCl}_L(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UCl}_L[A]=\\{\\mathrm{UCl}_L(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subst}_L(\\varphi,t,x)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq L'","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"a_F(c)=0","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"a_R(P)=r","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_G","display":false}],"bytes":3587,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本次修复重点为：同语言系统族的 Con/Complete/Th 签名，开放 PA 公理的全称闭包，IΔ0 演算中的逻辑公理，一般语言的语法/语义/有限演算，以及集合论扩展的成员语言类型。固定点复杂度条目补给具体见证；Craig 与创造集条目补给可检查的构造步骤。[[92-df-universal-closure]]、[[92-df-first-order-language]]、[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]、[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]记录新增接口。"},{"id":"83eb2b67a65ec154","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}$ and $\\mathrm{FV}_{\\in}$ (formulas and free-variable function for the first-order language $\\{\\in\\}$; 见[[92-df-first-order-language]]的 $\\mathcal L_\\in$ 实例)"},{"id":"bc49b3195ceaea0d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f1751959740e455f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"所有模式变元 $A,B,C$ 范围为 $\\mathrm{Fml}_L$，$x\\in V$、$t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_L$；代入采用[[92-df-first-order-language]]。"},{"id":"1c09889422d33e53","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"28c39f1dc8b3e62b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)$；$L'$ 仅在 $L$ 的关系符号集加入新符号 $P$，并给定 $a_R(P)=r\\in\\mathbb N$，见[[92-df-first-order-language]]。"},{"id":"0b146f0add46bd47","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)$，$L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)$，$V=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}$；语法见[[92-df-first-order-language]]。"},{"id":"66c9470f107a6bad","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UCl}_\\in$ 是成员语言的全称闭包，见[[92-df-first-order-language]]；按递增变量下标绑定自由参数。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]] → [[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]] → [[92-df-first-order-derivation]]供语言扩张与成员语言使用。非标准模型见[[92-ex-nonstandard-model]]；集合论背景见[[92-df-zfc]]、[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis]]、[[92-df-constructible-universe]]、[[92-df-forcing]]与[[92-thm-ch-independence]]。这些背景不冒充原书的算术语法或定理证明。"},{"id":"1a9a64dce00ebd76","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bf5133176eaa12c8","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对[[92-df-first-order-language]]中的任意集合签名 $L$ 和 $T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$、$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]的有限演算满足"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-159","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]]"}],"outgoing":[]}